    "result_text": "The only remaining `checkDigit` references are the internal `MemberId.checkDigit(...)` helper that computes the CHK segment \u2014 the standalone field is gone. The change is complete and the full test suite is green.\n\n## Summary\n\nUnified `customerCode` + `membershipNumber` into a single `memberId` formatted `<REGION><FY><HASH8><CHK>`, and removed the derived `checkDigit` field.\n\n**New / renamed logic**\n- **`util/MemberId.java`** (new, replaces `util/CustomerCode.java`) \u2014 `of(region, registrationDate, telephone, lastName)` assembles `REGION` + 2-digit `FY` (`FiscalYear.of % 100`) + `HASH8` (SHA-256 over `telephone+lastName`, first 8 upper-hex) + `CHK` (single Luhn digit over the digits of `<REGION><FY><HASH8>`). `hash8` and the Luhn helper carried over unchanged.\n- **`function/owner/AssignMemberId.java`** (new, replaces `AssignCustomerCode`) \u2014 computes the memberId and applies **collision handling to the memberId** (`-<n>` suffix), storing via `owner.setMemberId(...)`.\n\n**References updated to memberId**\n- **`model/Owner.java`** \u2014 field/column/accessors `customerCode`/`customer_code` \u2192 `memberId`/`member_id`.\n- **`db/{h2,hsqldb,mysql,postgres}/schema.sql`** \u2014 column renamed (widened to `VARCHAR(40)`/`TEXT` to fit the longer id plus any collision suffix).\n- **`officefloor/rest/api/owners.POST.yml`** \u2014 step `assignCustomerCode` \u2192 `assignMemberId` (new class).\n- **`function/owner/AuditOwnerCreated.java`** \u2014 audit line now logs `memberId=`; membershipNumber computation removed.\n- **`function/owner/OwnerCreatedEvent.java`** \u2014 the audit event's identifier is now the memberId; JSON key `customerCode` \u2192 `memberId`.\n- **`mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 dropped `checkDigit` and `membershipNumber` mappings; `memberId` auto-maps from `getMemberId()`; `locality`/`timezone`/`ownerSegment` region now derived from `Locality.of(city, postcode)` instead of parsing the old code.\n- **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 removed `customerCode`, `checkDigit`, `membershipNumber` schemas; added `memberId`.\n\n**Verification:** `owner created id=11 memberId=NSW2716E6609E1 \u2026` \u2014 NSW + FY `27` + HASH8 `16E6609E` + Luhn `1`. `AcceptanceTest` and the full suite pass (`BUILD SUCCESS`).",
